OL,3,GNEWSARNLI volunteers speak out over
OL,4,Alifeboat changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FCurrent and former RNLI volunteers have
OL,7,Fraised concerns over cutbacks to the
OL,8,Fcharity's services.
OL,10,FIt comes after an announcement this
OL,11,Fweek that Port St Mary's all-weather
OL,12,Flifeboat will be retired in 2028 and
OL,13,Fwill not be replaced.
OL,15,FAndy Faragher, a former crew member at
OL,16,Fthe village station, said downscaling
OL,17,Fwas "fundamentally flawed" with boats
OL,18,Ffrom other areas taking longer in
OL,19,F"serious sea conditions" and increasing
OL,20,Frisk.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
