OL,3,GNEWSARNLI volunteers speak out over
OL,4,Alifeboat changes
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RNLI said it "believes the
OL,7,Flifeboats allocated through this
OL,8,Fstrategy will continue to meet the
OL,9,Flifesaving needs of the communities
OL,10,Fthey serve."
